ent-MedicalBeamGun = medigun
    .desc = A powered medical projector that treats a patient while its beam remains on them. Does not replenish blood or stop bleeding.
medical-beam-gun-examine = Hold primary fire in combat mode and aim at a patient to heal them. Range: [color=yellow]{ $range }[/color] meters. Only one medigun can treat a patient at a time.
medical-beam-gun-charge = The cell has enough charge for [color=yellow]{ $seconds }[/color] seconds of treatment.
medical-beam-gun-no-cell = [color=red]No power cell installed.[/color]
